  "observations": [
    "SI p3 prepares diene 8 from acetylacetone in 63% crude yield; E/Z mixture is not resolved.",
    "4 + 8 gives isolated 6 (67%) and 9 (2%) through a one-pot cycloaddition/acid treatment.",
    "Main article confirms C8/C9 stereochemistry of 6 by X-ray. SI drawing of 9 leaves those centers unspecified.",
    "Photochemical debenzylation of 6 gives 1 in 55% isolated yield.",
    "The three inherited stereocenters and assigned centers in 6/1 are transcribed from source wedge drawings using explicit coordinates; temporary atom maps are removed from identity SMILES."
